  "body_excerpt": "It was discovered that the Ceph Object Gateway (RGW) SigV4 handler did not\nreject requests carrying x-amz-* headers that were absent from the signed\nheader set. An attacker holding a presigned URL could possibly use this issue to\nattach arbitrary unsigned x-amz-* headers that RGW would honor, allowing them to escalate\ntheir privileges beyond what the URL's signer intended.",
